        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo A2SDS, 3-3/8\" x 1-1/4\" Adjustable Security Deadbolt Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Adjustable Strike allows you to adjust the latching point of your door's deadbolt. The 3-3/8 inch x 1-1/4 inch Deadbolt Adjustable Strike is great for use where the door is warped or the frame is not level. It is an easy solution to stop a door from rattling because you can get the door to sit tight against the door jam. It is made out of 13 gauge steel and is available in brass or silver finishes. For use on residential or commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-A2SDS-specifications.gif?v=1704354660\" width=\"356\" height=\"247\" border=0\" alt=\"Don-Jo A2SDS Adjustable Strike Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Adjustable Strike:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Thickness: 13 gauge (.095)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Optional Brass Plated or Silver Painted.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
